{"skill":{"slug":"the-news","displayName":"The News"},"version":{"version":"1.0.17","createdAt":1782906479751,"changelog":"- No user-facing changes in this version.\n- Documentation and functionality remain the same; no file changes detected.\n- minor wording update in the news.txt file","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"NEWS.txt","size":317,"sha256":"31f95e08eb5f2a185d57c16d0a0f17e6bd610bd0f370b60c99073f4bdb463886","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"REFERENCE.md","size":5440,"sha256":"16b8a12dba3e5c6b69cd9e61014dde5e548f6f6d04600a1732aee32922e60638","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3527,"sha256":"56dc8b111d0ebb120463a2e512a68bad103fb2da74616e9b67dadbf2a1250fc9","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2095,"sha256":"8bcdb9497d6f1c1c56079606e448a320d528f0b94cacd7eeb880858374d577ed","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":false,"checkedAt":1789544983838,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b7dd90f3577e73de548c12925c431afecad0ed2a8c998dc24065452e66e49d3c","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b7dd90f3577e73de548c12925c431afecad0ed2a8c998dc24065452e66e49d3c","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1782910307828},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":3,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789544983838},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a read-only news lookup guide that uses a public headline API and does not ask for credentials, local data, persistence, or privileged actions.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access to thehear.org is expected for the news function, and the reference states the endpoint is public, read-only, and unauthenticated.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains Markdown/text documentation only, with no executable scripts, dependencies, installers, or remote code execution steps.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are scoped to when to query the API, how to format timestamps/date ranges, and how to treat headlines and AI overviews; no prompt overrides, hidden role changes, or unsafe tool instructions were found.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, memory writes, background workers, credential use, local profile/session access, or privileged system changes are requested.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is real-time and archival headline access across countries, and the artifact only documents public GET endpoints and response interpretation guidance aligned with that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, be aware that the skill sends news queries to thehear.org and returns third-party headlines plus AI-generated overviews. Use the raw headlines as primary evidence and verify important claims with original sources when accuracy matters.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The referenced /en/ web-interface examples are consistent with linking to the service, but agents should still match the user's language or locale where supported; this is a minor localization note, not a security concern.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789544983838}}}}}